<section class="fpg-fo-sec" id="features"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">How the ST6D 24 is built</h2><ul class="fpg-fo-feats" role="list">
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-kubota24.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-kubota24.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-kubota24.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>24hp Kubota diesel</h3><p>A naturally aspirated Kubota with no DPF to look after: the simpler, lower-cost way into a diesel 6-inch.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Open-top flywheel</h3><p>A 640 × 25 mm flywheel with twin 8-inch blades throws the chip instead of blowing it, so wet, green material is far less likely to block the chute.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-hopper.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-hopper.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-hopper.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Wide hopper</h3><p>Wide all the way down to the rollers, so forks and awkward limbs go in without trimming.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>AutoIntelligence control</h3><p>Sealed electronics that run the no-stress feed, tell you when a service is due and prompt the routine checks. Proof against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-under750.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-under750.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-under750.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Built to last</h3><p>Flanged steel fabrications, finished properly, with a C-section chassis.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Easy-access anvil</h3><p>The anvil turns or swaps in minutes, so a fresh edge is never a workshop job.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Clear fuel tank</h3><p>A see-through 30-litre tank with a wide filler neck. You can read the level from across the yard.</p></div></li>
</ul></div></section>
